# SnowOps Labs

## IDE & local files
.env
.DS_Store
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.vscode/

## Go build output (golden rule 6: never commit build artifacts)
bin/
dist/
*.exe
apps/echo-server/echo-server
apps/go-api/go-api
apps/go-api/app

## Coverage output
coverage.out
test-time.log
coverage.html
.coverage-func.txt

## Embedded UI in the binary (copied at build time by make cli-build)
src/internal/webui/dist/*
!src/internal/webui/dist/.gitkeep

## Vitest's run cache — a build artifact, and it changes on every test run
src/.vite/

## SPA build output and dependencies
src/ui/node_modules/
src/ui/dist/*
!src/ui/dist/.gitkeep
src/ui/.env.local
src/ui/*.tsbuildinfo

## UI test output
src/ui/coverage/
src/ui/test-results/
src/ui/playwright-report/
src/ui/blob-report/
src/ui/.playwright/

## Docker
*.tar

## OS
Thumbs.db

## Local runtime state (written by labctl at runtime, never committed)
.labctl/
.snowops/

